{"id": 15331, "title": "See you there", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "see-you-there", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/15331_see-you-there.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["A：现在几点？", "B：差五分两点。怎么了？", "A：我两点半要去咖啡店见朋友。", "B：你见谁？", "A：我的小学同学，林林。你见过她的。", "B：我知道了，那个很爱笑的姑娘。你们晚上一起吃饭吗？", "A：还不知道。我们只打算一起喝喝咖啡，聊聊天。", "B：你们喝完来旁边的公园吧。下午我会和几个朋友去公园晒太阳，然后一起玩飞盘。你们也来吧！", "A：听起来不错！你们几个人？几点开始玩？", "B：我们有五个人，打算三点一刻在公园门口见面。", "A：太好了，下午我们也来。不见不散！"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["A：現在幾點？", "B：差五分兩點。怎麼了？", "A：我兩點半要去咖啡店見朋友。", "B：你見誰？", "A：我的小學同學，林林。你見過她的。", "B：我知道了，那個很愛笑的姑娘。你們晚上一起吃飯嗎？", "A：還不知道。我們只打算一起喝喝咖啡，聊聊天。", "B：你們喝完來旁邊的公園吧。下午我會和幾個朋友去公園曬太陽，然後一起玩飛盤。你們也來吧！", "A：聽起來不錯！你們幾個人？幾點開始玩？", "B：我們有五個人，打算三點一刻在公園門口見面。", "A：太好了，下午我們也來。不見不散！"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["A： xiàn zài jǐ diǎn？", "B： chà wǔ fēn liǎng diǎn。 zěn me le？", "A： wǒ liǎng diǎn bàn yào qù kā fēi diàn jiàn péng you。", "B： nǐ jiàn shéi？", "A： wǒ de xiǎo xué tóng xué， Lín Lín。 nǐ jiàn guo tā de。", "B： wǒ zhī dào le， nà gè hěn ài xiào de gū niang。 nǐ men wǎn shang yī qǐ chī fàn ma？", "A： hái bù zhī dào。 wǒ men zhǐ dǎ suàn yī qǐ hē hē kā fēi， liáo liáo tiān。", "B： nǐ men hē wán lái páng biān de gōng yuán ba。 xià wǔ wǒ huì hé jǐ gè péng you qù gōng yuán shài tài yáng， rán hòu yī qǐ wán fēi pán。 nǐ men yě lái ba！", "A： tīng qǐ lái bù cuò！ nǐ men jǐ gè rén？ jǐ diǎn kāi shǐ wán？", "B： wǒ men yǒu wǔ gè rén， dǎ suàn sān diǎn yī kè zài gōng yuán mén kǒu jiàn miàn。", "A： tài hǎo le， xià wǔ wǒ men yě lái。 bù jiàn bù sàn！"], "english_paragraphs": ["A: What time is it now?", "B: Five minutes and two points. What's wrong?", "A: I'm going to the coffee shop to meet my friends at half past two.", "B: Who are you meeting?", "A: My elementary school classmate, Lin Lin. You've seen her.", "B: I know, that girl who loves to laugh. Are you having dinner together tonight?", "A: I don’t know yet. We were just going to drink coffee and chat.", "B: After you finish drinking, come to the park next door. In the afternoon I would go to the park with a few friends to bask in the sun and play Frisbee together. Come on, too!", "A: Sounds great! How many of you are there? What time does the game start?", "B: There are five of us and we plan to meet at the gate of the park at 3:15.", "A: Great, we will come in the afternoon too. See you there or not!"], "english_full": "A: What time is it now?\n\nB: Five minutes and two points. What's wrong?\n\nA: I'm going to the coffee shop to meet my friends at half past two.\n\nB: Who are you meeting?\n\nA: My elementary school classmate, Lin Lin. You've seen her.\n\nB: I know, that girl who loves to laugh. Are you having dinner together tonight?\n\nA: I don’t know yet. We were just going to drink coffee and chat.\n\nB: After you finish drinking, come to the park next door. In the afternoon I would go to the park with a few friends to bask in the sun and play Frisbee together. Come on, too!\n\nA: Sounds great! How many of you are there? What time does the game start?\n\nB: There are five of us and we plan to meet at the gate of the park at 3:15.\n\nA: Great, we will come in the afternoon too. See you there or not!", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><span class=\"tr\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiàn zài\" data-defn=\"now; at present; currently\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jǐ\" data-defn=\"how much / how many\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">几</span><span class=\"tr\">幾</span><rt>jǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"diǎn\" data-defn=\"point; dot; spot; speck / dot stroke in Chinese characters / (math.) decimal point / point in time or space / (after a number) o&#x27;clock\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby>？", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">B</span><span class=\"tr\">B</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chà\" data-defn=\"to fall short; to lack\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">差</span><span class=\"tr\">差</span><rt>chà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǔ\" data-defn=\"five / 5\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">五</span><span class=\"tr\">五</span><rt>wǔ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fēn\" data-defn=\"minute (unit of time)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">分</span><span class=\"tr\">分</span><rt>fēn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"liǎng\" data-defn=\"two / both / some / a few\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"diǎn\" data-defn=\"point; dot; spot; speck / dot stroke in Chinese characters / (math.) decimal point / point in time or space / (after a number) o&#x27;clock\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zěn me\" data-defn=\"how? / what? / why?\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">怎么</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麼</span><rt>zěn me</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby>？", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><span class=\"tr\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"liǎng\" data-defn=\"two / both / some / a few\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"diǎn\" data-defn=\"point; dot; spot; speck / dot stroke in Chinese characters / (math.) decimal point / point in time or space / (after a number) o&#x27;clock\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bàn\" data-defn=\"(after a number) and a half\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">半</span><span class=\"tr\">半</span><rt>bàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yào\" data-defn=\"will; shall; about to / need to; should / if\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qù\" data-defn=\"to go, to go to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kā fēi\" data-defn=\"(loanword) coffee\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">咖啡</span><span class=\"tr\">咖啡</span><rt>kā fēi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"diàn\" data-defn=\"(bound form) shop; store\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">店</span><span class=\"tr\">店</span><rt>diàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiàn\" data-defn=\"to see / to meet / to appear (to be sth) / to interview\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"péng you\" data-defn=\"friend\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng you</rt></ruby>。", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">B</span><span class=\"tr\">B</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiàn\" data-defn=\"to see / to meet / to appear (to be sth) / to interview\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=