ata-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby>。", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">B</span><span class=\"tr\">B</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhī dào\" data-defn=\"to know; to become aware of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">知道</span><span class=\"tr\">知道</span><rt>zhī dào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nà\" data-defn=\"(specifier) that; the; those / (pronoun) that (referring to persons, things or situations)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hěn\" data-defn=\"very; quite\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ài\" data-defn=\"to love; to be fond of; to like\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">爱</span><span class=\"tr\">愛</span><rt>ài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiào\" data-defn=\"to laugh; to smile\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">笑</span><span class=\"tr\">笑</span><rt>xiào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gū niang\" data-defn=\"girl / young woman / young lady / daughter / paternal aunt (old)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">姑娘</span><span class=\"tr\">姑娘</span><rt>gū niang</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ men\" data-defn=\"you (plural)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你们</span><span class=\"tr\">你們</span><rt>nǐ men</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǎn shang\" data-defn=\"in the evening\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shang</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī qǐ\" data-defn=\"together; in company (with)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chī fàn\" data-defn=\"to have a meal / to eat\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">吃饭</span><span class=\"tr\">吃飯</span><rt>chī fàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ma\" data-defn=\"(question particle for &quot;yes-no&quot; questions)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby>？", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><span class=\"tr\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hái\" data-defn=\"still, still in progress, yet\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">还</span><span class=\"tr\">還</span><rt>hái</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhī dào\" data-defn=\"to know; to become aware of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">知道</span><span class=\"tr\">知道</span><rt>zhī dào</rt></ruby>。<ruby